@@ -0,0 +1,333 @@
+---
+baseline_commit: ea232af
+---
+
+# Story 4.11: Historical Organization & Headcount Reconstruction
+
+Status: review
+
+<!-- Note: Validation is optional. Run validate-create-story for quality check before dev-story. -->
+
+## Story
+
+As an authorized user,
+I want historical Team/organization counts and headcount quantities for a supported date,
+So that transfers and corrections affect totals only at resolved effective points (FR27).
+
+## Gate (read first)
+
+**This story ships FR-27 as-of reconstruction of Team membership counts, organization unit counts, and approved/used/reserved/free headcount quantities under one metric catalogue ΓÇö built on existing Primary/OrgUnit as-of helpers + an event-linked headcount ledger read (not live slot counters for historical dates). It does not ship Headcount Approval lifecycle, Matching, Override catalogue, dashboard/report products, or new write Operators.**
+
+| Allowed in 4.11 | Forbidden in 4.11 |
+| --- | --- |
+| Product `asOf` date-only (Tehran) for org + headcount reconstruction | Treating `headcount_capacity_slot.free_units` / `reserved_units` as historical truth for `asOf < today` |
+| Metric catalogue: membership, org-unit counts by type, approved/used/reserved/free | Inventing Headcount Approval entity / lifecycle (ΓåÆ 4.12) |
+| Membership from Primary half-open as-of (Transfer moves count only at Effective) | Counting Secondary as Team membership; inventing AR-SECONDARY headcount |
+| Headcount used/reserved reconstructed from consumption + reservation rows **joined to business events** (effective + lifecycle) | Full event-log replay on GET to rebuild Primary/OrgUnit; new denormalized historical SoT table |
+| Detail rows + aggregate totals that deep-equal under the same catalogue | Divergent ad-hoc SQL in web routers that disagree with module metrics |
+| Thin governed tRPC + optional foreshadow (Jalali as-of + tabular numerals) | Full dashboard (ΓåÆ 5.4); launch report catalogue (ΓåÆ 5.5); `/headcount` Approval admin UI (ΓåÆ 4.12) |
+| Baseline disclosure + future `asOf` planned semantics (mirror 4.10 patterns where applicable) | Inventing default Baseline epoch; labeling future totals as Effective early |
+| Selfchecks: Transfer effective-point membership; Scheduled reserve vs Effective consume; detailΓëíaggregate | UTF-8 BOM on `sprint-status.yaml`; Vitest mandate without ephemeral DB; PopulationPort cutover |
+
+### Mandated design ΓÇö compose as-of projections (non-negotiable)
+
+```text
+kernel_events (SoT)
+  ΓåÆ AD-6 hooks ΓåÆ Primary / OrgUnit / headcount_capacity_* rows
+        Γöé
+        Γö£ΓöÇ membership: listTeamMembersAsOf / Primary active-as-of (person-employment)
+        Γö£ΓöÇ org counts: getHierarchyAsOf / OrgUnit active-as-of by unitType
+        ΓööΓöÇ headcount quantities: NEW reconstructHeadcountQuantitiesAsOf (headcount module)
+              used/reserved from ledger + getBusinessEventById (effective + lifecycle)
+              approved / free via metric catalogue identity (below)
+                    Γöé
+                    Γû╝
+getHistoricalOrgHeadcountState({ asOf, scope? })   # coordinator (person-employment)
+  ΓåÆ same catalogue for detail + aggregate
+  ΓåÆ viewSemantics + baselineDisclosure (reuse 4.10 helpers)
+```
+
+- **Do not** create `OrgHeadcountSnapshot` / historical SoT Prisma table.
+- **Do not** call `apply*Projection` / capacity mutate APIs from the read path.
+- **Do not** use `readHeadcountCapacityPanel` alone for historical `asOf` ΓÇö that API reads **live** counters (correct for UX-DR13 finalize panel / today; wrong as FR-27 history).
+- **Do not** import `@divan/person-employment` from `@divan/headcount` (dependency direction: person-employment ΓåÆ headcount already exists). Put capacity as-of **in headcount**; put org/membership assembly + coordinator **in person-employment** (or thin web adapter that only calls public APIs).
+
+### Mandated design ΓÇö metric catalogue (FR-27 reconcile)
+
+Single catalogue used by detail rows and aggregates. Names may vary in code; semantics must not.
+
+| Metric key | Definition (MVP / pre-Approval) | Source of truth for as-of |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `teamMembershipCount` | Persons with **Primary** Team membership active at `asOf` (FR-11) | `listTeamMembersAsOf(teamId, asOf)` length (or equivalent Primary query with same half-open rules) |
+| `orgUnitCount` by `unitType` | OrgUnits active at `asOf` (LE / BU / DEPARTMENT / TEAM, ΓÇª) | `getHierarchyAsOf` / `isOrgUnitActiveAsOf` |
+| `used` | Capacity units **consumed and not yet released** as of `asOf` | `headcount_capacity_consumption` where consume event Effective Γëñ asOf **and** (no release **or** release event Effective > asOf); Cancelled/Reversed consume events excluded via lifecycle |
+| `reserved` | Capacity units held by active Reservation as of `asOf` | `headcount_capacity_reservation` linked to Finalized transfer/title event that is still **Scheduled** at `asOf` (lifecycle), or reservation `status='reserved'` and event not yet Effective at `asOf`; converted/released do not count |
+| `approved` | Slot capacity ceiling for the as-of interval | **Until 4.12:** conserved slot size `approved = used_live + reserved_live + free_live` from **current** counters (or equivalent seed ceiling) for slots whose validity contains `asOf` ΓÇö document as Approval-stand-in; **do not invent** Approval rows |
+| `free` | `approved - used - reserved` (may be computed; never silently floor negative if Override later ΓÇö Override ΓåÆ 4.14) | Catalogue identity; for MVP without Override, free ΓëÑ 0 |
+
+**Conservation (selfcheck):** for each in-scope slot at a given `asOf`, `approved === used + reserved + free`.
+
+**Detail vs aggregate:** `sum(detail.teamMembershipCount)` over scoped teams === aggregate membership; same for headcount quantities. Oracle: two callers / detail-rollups deep-equal under `*FactsForCompare` helper.
+
+### Mandated design ΓÇö effective points (FR-27 / UJ-1)
+
+| Change | Membership / org counts | Headcount used | Headcount reserved |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| Future Transfer **Finalized** (Scheduled) | Source Team count unchanged until Effective | Source still used | Destination **reserved** (FR-30) |
+| Transfer **Effective** | Source ΓêÆ1 / dest +1 at Effective date | Source released; dest used (convert) | Reservation converted ΓÇö not reserved |
+| Correction / Reverse | Only at resolved lifecycle + projection intervals | Follow release/consume undo already written by Operators | Follow reservation release/convert already written |
+| Secondary Assignment | **Never** in membership counts by default | No headcount | ΓÇö |
+
+### Mandated design ΓÇö past / today / future as-of
+
+Reuse `@divan/temporal-engine` `parseDateOnly`, `todayDateOnlyTehran`, `isFutureAsOf`, and `getBaselineBoundaryDate` from 4.10.
+
+| `asOf` vs today | `viewSemantics` | Behavior |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `asOf === today` | `current` | Membership/org as-of today; headcount may use live panel **or** ledger path if ledger Γëí live (selfcheck both agree for fixture) |
+| `asOf < today` | `historical` | Membership/org as-of; headcount **must** use ledger reconstruction ΓÇö **not** live `free_units` |
+| `asOf > today` | `planned` | Membership/org facts stay at **today**; expose planned capacity/membership deltas separately (Scheduled transfers through asOf) ΓÇö **never** label future membership/capacity as Effective |
+
+Invalid `asOf` ΓåÆ fail-closed. Baseline disclosure: same honesty rules as 4.10 (`limited` / not configured) ΓÇö attach to reconstruction payload.
+
+### Mandated design ΓÇö API / UI surface
+
+| Layer | Delivery |
+| --- | --- |
+| `@divan/headcount` | `reconstructHeadcountQuantitiesAsOf(db, { asOf, teamId?, slotId? })` (+ types); keep `readHeadcountCapacityPanel` for finalize UX |
+| `@divan/person-employment` | `getHistoricalOrgHeadcountState` (or equivalent) composing membership + org counts + headcount public API |
+| tRPC | Governed procedure e.g. `organization.getHistoricalCounts` and/or `headcount.getStateAsOf` ΓÇö Zod date-only via `parseDateOnly`; coarse `person.read` / `organization.read` (reuse existing) ΓÇö **do not invent** FR-47 toxic matrix |
+| UI | Optional foreshadow near `/personnel` or org surface: Jalali as-of, membership + capacity table with `{tabular}` numerals (UX-DR13 family); Persian empty/error ΓÇö **not** full dashboard |
+| Permissions | Coarse read only; omit out-of-scope Teams if scope filter already exists ΓÇö fail closed if required inputs missing |
+
+### Mandated design ΓÇö freshness
+
+If platform exposes org-/slot-level recalc pending for affected Persons in scope, fail-closed or return typed freshness (do not serve gold historical totals while known recalc is pending for people in the counted set). Prefer reusing existing recalculation signals; do not invent a second banner system.
+
+[Source: `epics.md` Story 4.11; `prd.md` FR-27, FR-11, FR-16, FR-18, FR-25ΓÇôFR-26, FR-30; `ARCHITECTURE-SPINE.md` AD-2, AD-3, AD-6, PROJECTION_HISTORICAL; Stories 4.7, 4.9, 4.10; UX-DR13]
+
+## Acceptance Criteria
+
+1. **Given** a supported historical date (Asia/Tehran date-only) and permitted scope  
+   **When** historical Team/org/headcount counts are requested for `asOf Γëñ today`  
+   **Then** Team membership counts, organization unit counts, and approved/used/reserved/free headcount reconstruct under the metric catalogue above ΓÇö membership from Primary as-of helpers; headcount from event-linked ledger (not live counters for historical dates)
+
+2. **And** transfers and corrections affect membership totals only at resolved Effective points; Scheduled Transfer keeps source membership until Effective while destination shows reserved capacity (FR-30 / UJ-1)
+
+3. **And** detailed and aggregate results reconcile under the same metric catalogue (selfcheck: rollup equality)
+
+4. **And** future `asOf` uses planned semantics (facts @ today + planned channel); Baseline limitations disclosed; invalid `asOf` rejected fail-closed
+
+5. **And** Stories 4.1ΓÇô4.10 invariants remain green; this story does **not** deliver Headcount Approval/Matching/Override (4.12ΓÇô4.14), Epic 5 dashboard/reports, PopulationPort cutover, or new Personnel Event Operators
+
+## Tasks / Subtasks
+
